sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Clip
    participant R as 接收器
    participant F as 原件磁盘
    participant D as registry
    participant B as business
    C->>R: OPEN / DATA，设备凭证与 size/hash
    R->>D: 核验有效绑定和 owner
    R->>F: 写入，fsync，持久检查点
    R-->>C: 只 ACK 已持久偏移
    R->>F: 完整 hash，rename，目录 fsync
    R->>D: sources ready 持久；本行就是待投影项
    R-->>C: COMPLETE：原件已可靠收下
    D->>B: business 同事务：录音 + segments 原件/幂等收据
    B-->>D: 业务提交后标 sources.projected_at
    Note over D,B: 启动分批全量对账；重复来源只生效一次；不等待 WAV / ASR / VTT 才确认设备
